@host = http://localhost:5162

### R1 - Consultar planes (no requiere asesor)
GET {{host}}/api/plans
Accept: application/json

### R2 - Registrar venta como asesor A
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: A

{
  "planCode": "ACC_ESENCIAL",
  "buyerName": "Juan Perez",
  "buyerEmail": "juan@ejemplo.test",
  "requestReference": "REF-A-0001"
}

### R3 - Reenvío idéntico (mismo asesor, misma referencia) -> devuelve la MISMA venta, sin consumir cupo
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: A

{
  "planCode": "ACC_ESENCIAL",
  "buyerName": "Juan Perez",
  "buyerEmail": "juan@ejemplo.test",
  "requestReference": "REF-A-0001"
}

### R3 - Misma referencia con datos distintos -> 409 REFERENCE_CONFLICT (se conserva la original)
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: A

{
  "planCode": "ACC_PLUS",
  "buyerName": "Pedro Gomez",
  "buyerEmail": "pedro@ejemplo.test",
  "requestReference": "REF-A-0001"
}

### R3 - Asesor B compra el mismo plan (referencia propia). Si Esencial ya no tiene cupo -> 409 NO_QUOTA_AVAILABLE
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: B

{
  "planCode": "ACC_ESENCIAL",
  "buyerName": "Ana Lopez",
  "buyerEmail": "ana@ejemplo.test",
  "requestReference": "REF-B-0001"
}

### R2 - Registrar venta plan Plus como asesor B
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: B

{
  "planCode": "ACC_PLUS",
  "buyerName": "Ana Lopez",
  "buyerEmail": "ana@ejemplo.test",
  "requestReference": "REF-B-0002"
}

### R4 - Consultar ventas propias del asesor A (paginado, 20 por página)
GET {{host}}/api/sales?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: A

### R4 - Consultar ventas propias del asesor B
GET {{host}}/api/sales?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: B

### Error - Sin header de asesor -> 401 UNAUTHORIZED_ADVISOR
GET {{host}}/api/sales
Accept: application/json

### Error - Datos inválidos (email) -> 400 INVALID_SALE_DATA
POST {{host}}/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json
X-Advisor-Id: A

{
  "planCode": "ACC_PLUS",
  "buyerName": "Test",
  "buyerEmail": "correo-invalido",
  "requestReference": "REF-A-9999"
}
